## Commands
- Install: `<uv sync>` / `<pip install -r requirements.txt>`
- Run: `<uv run python -m app>`
- Test: `<uv run pytest -q>` — a single test: `<uv run pytest path::test_name>`
- Lint/format: `<uv run ruff check --fix .>` / `<uv run ruff format .>`
- Types: `<uv run mypy .>`

